                    "sense_definition": "Used to emphasize a negative or a lack of interest; absolutely.",
                    "learner_level": "B2",
                    "frequency": "Middle",
                    "semantic_group_id": "intensifier",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "I <w>super</w> don't care about what he thinks of my new car.",
